  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "Odin Manufacturing built this for former KungsArmé soldiers after they got folded into the Ghost Bear Dominion. Those veterans wanted something that fit how they fought and the Dengier delivered. Ten official variants by 3155, which tells you how well the base chassis worked. Ghost Bear warriors eventually started using it too, which is about as good an endorsement as you can get.",
